nvincible machine that just can't  be beaten in hand-to-hand combat this  ties in nicely to its next ability which  is that the blast heinz physical  strength will continue to grow during  the 13 years the user possesses it what  this means in reality is that when a  person first inherits the shifter  they'll have a base level of power  similar to the beast titan but as the  monsoon years go on its strength will  progressively keep increasing the speed  at which it increases would depend on  how active the user is but generally  speaking this shifter would start to  reach its peak at around 9 years old by  that point it should be able to easily  jump over 60 meters high and probably  even higher than that and would be able  to knock down the colossal if they put  everything into it the power to jump  this high also has another benefit as  it's the core element of this shifter's  most destructive move  to put it simply this signature attack  involves the blast titan launching  itself as high as it can possibly go and  then after curling up into a ball this  18 meter shifter crashes directly into  his target the target in question could  be another titan in which case that  person is most likely gonna die or on  the other hand the target might just be  the ground itself a shifter of this size  would almost be like a small asteroid  crashing into earth with the impact  creating a blast of wind strong enough  to wipe out an entire town  the destructive potential of this move  would be especially bad if it took place  in a highly populated area which is why  i said in the intro that it's nearly in  the same league as the colossal however  the drawback here is that the blastine  has low levels of stamina so although it  is capable of these insane feats of  strength it's not something that can be  done consistently on a good day the  shifter would need at least 30 minutes  to recover before doing something like  this again and as the user themselves  starts to get old the recovery time can  increase to as long as two hours  during that recovery time it'd still be  able to fight in hand-to-hand combat but  the super-powered staff would be  completely off limits this is a natural  way of not allowing his titan to become  too overpowered and it'd also mean the  user would need to be tactical in  deciding when to use its full potential  now moving on to design the helmet on  the blast iron's head is there to  protect its brain from the impact while  in the present day it will protect from  anti-time bullets as well i'd imagine  the smaller cannons wouldn't be able to  break through this thing even at close  range although when it comes to the  larger ones they probably would be able  to break through but i'd still think it  would take two or three hits before it  could crack  despite that this helmet would still  have another more spiritual use which  involves protecting the shifter in a  different way as long as the helmet is  on users of the blast titan become  immune from the influence of the founder  in a pretty much identical way to the  acumens this means the user's memories  can't be controlled or messed with while  they're in the titan form and his body  also can't be altered by the coordinate  which is a big contrast to other  shifters  this level of telepathic resistance  would essentially make the founding  titan and the blast titan natural  enemies as it's incapable of being  manipulated and has the physical  strength to stand against virtually  anything  from that point of view i think it's  fair to say that users of the attacked  item would be pretty good candidates for  this shifter as it would objectively  have the most potential to stand against  the founder  anyhow some final details i wanted to  clear up about this titan include its  stats the number of transformations it  can make and how exactly it grows in  physical strength starting with that  last point the idea behind this is that  it would gradually inherit the power of  the previous users similar to how it  also inherits their fighting instincts  of course the key difference is that the  instincts would be inherited almost  immediately while the physical strength  would take years to fully kick in the  reason for this is that number one i  thought it would be cool to have a titan  that actually grows in strength  alongside its user and number two  gaining its full power up front could  potentially be risky to me it makes more  sense for a person to slowly build their  way up to that level of strength but to  be fair i guess the counter argument  would be that the users of the colossal  gain even more strength pretty much  straight away in terms of how many  transformations it can make for the  first seven or eight years the blast  titan should be able to manifest twice a  day after about a decade its stamina  would then naturally begin to decrease  with one transformation per day becoming  the new limit which is ironic because  around this age is when the shifter  would physically be at its strongest  lastly when it comes to stats overall it  would have a 7 out of 10 for durability  a 10 out of 10 for power 5 out of 10 for  speed 8 out of 10 for resistance to the  founder and 12 out of 10 for combat  ordinarily i would have left combat at  11 out of 10 but when looking into the  official guidebook annie's female titan  has 11 so i figured it needed to at  least be slightly higher than that when  we compare the blast titan stats to the  other shifters it also matches up pretty  well as it'd be the second strongest  behind the colossal but would lose to  the armored when it comes to speed and  durability  ultimately if this tenth titan was in  this series it'd definitely be one of  the most valuable although strategically  speaking it'll also be the only shifter  that khan reaches full potential until  nearly a decade after being inherited  let me know in the comments down below  what you think of this titan concept and  also which side do you think would have  used it better as always thank you for  watching this video and if you liked it  don't forget to check out my playlist in  the description until the next one peace  out

